    <dc:subject>Romance</dc:subject>
    <dc:subject>Contemporary Fantasy</dc:subject>
    <dc:description>Version 3 English edition of a 113-chapter Korean-entertainment web serial. Song Ji-yeon, a Korean-American of Los Angeles, wakes in the Seoul of 2012 with a decade of hindsight — and one mission: keep the Crown from falling.</dc:description>
